  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 24 01 03 01 04 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}让您久等了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e801_140.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 24 01 0B 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}接下来的饮料，我都记得很清楚，\n请放心。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e801_140.bf.json:8:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 01 FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}“蜂焦拿茶”和“冰治抹拿茶”。\n这样没错吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e801_140.bf.json:9:0",
